flowchart TB
    START[PerformWalRecovery entry] --> INIT[XLogRecoveryCtl-&gt;lastReplayed*<br/>= REDO start]
    INIT --> RST[RmgrStartup<br/>per-rmgr init]
    RST --> READ0[ReadRecord<br/>positioning at first record]
    READ0 --> LOOP{record != NULL?}
    LOOP -->|yes| HSP[HandleStartupProcInterrupts]
    HSP --> PAU{recoveryPauseState<br/>!= NOT_PAUSED?}
    PAU -->|yes| RPH[recoveryPausesHere false<br/>blocks on CV]
    RPH --> SB
    PAU -->|no| SB{recoveryStopsBefore?}
    SB -->|yes| RT[reachedRecoveryTarget=true<br/>break]
    SB -->|no| DLY{recoveryApplyDelay<br/>commit-time based}
    DLY -->|wait| AWR
    DLY -->|no wait| AWR[ApplyWalRecord]
    AWR --> NEXT_XID[AdvanceNextFullTransactionIdPastXid]
    NEXT_XID --> TLI{TLI switch?<br/>CHECKPOINT_SHUTDOWN<br/>END_OF_RECOVERY}
    TLI -->|yes| CTLS[checkTimeLineSwitch]
    TLI -->|no| KAX
    CTLS --> KAX
    KAX{standbyState<br/>>= INITIALIZED?}
    KAX -->|yes| RKAT[RecordKnownAssignedTransactionIds]
    KAX -->|no| RXR
    RKAT --> RXR{rmid == RM_XLOG?}
    RXR -->|yes| XR[xlogrecovery_redo<br/>BACKUP_END / OVERWRITE_CONTRECORD]
    RXR -->|no| RMR
    XR --> RMR
    RMR[GetRmgr.rm_redo dispatch]
    RMR --> RMR_OUT[(22 rmgr callbacks)]
    RMR_OUT --> CONS{XLR_CHECK_CONSISTENCY?}
    CONS -->|yes| VBC[verifyBackupPageConsistency]
    CONS -->|no| LR
    VBC --> LR[update lastReplayedReadRecPtr<br/>lastReplayedEndRecPtr<br/>lastReplayedTLI]
    LR --> WSW{cascade_replication?}
    WSW -->|yes| WS[WalSndWakeup]
    WSW -->|no| CRC
    WS --> CRC[CheckRecoveryConsistency]
    CRC --> SA{recoveryStopsAfter?}
    SA -->|yes| RT
    SA -->|no| READ_NEXT[ReadRecord next]
    READ_NEXT --> LOOP
    LOOP -->|no| EOF[record==NULL: EOF]
    EOF --> END[break out of loop]
    RT --> END
    END --> CLN[RmgrCleanup]
    CLN --> ACT{recovery_target_action}
    ACT -->|shutdown| PE[proc_exit 3]
    ACT -->|pause| RPH2[recoveryPausesHere true]
    RPH2 --> RTRN[return]
    ACT -->|promote| RTRN
    ACT -->|none target hit| RTRN
